        array("id" => "s5e21", "season" => 5, "number" => 21, "name" => "Cell is Complete", "airdate" => "14 Oct 1992", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "An Infinite Battle Power!! The Birth of the God of Destruction is Named CellThe earth's greatest fear has come true: Cell is complete! Can anyone stop the android nightmare in his final, perfect form? As the heroes nervously line up, a glimmer of hope shines…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423777.jpg"),
