        array("id" => "s5e24", "season" => 5, "number" => 24, "name" => "Saving Throw", "airdate" => "4 Nov 1992", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Save Your Father!! Trunks' Fury, Which Scorches Even the HeavensVegeta lies unconscious after his battle with Cell, and Trunks unleashes his hidden powers to save his father's life. With Goku and Gohan still training, Trunks is the only person standing in the…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423780.jpg"),
