        array("id" => "s6e8", "season" => 6, "number" => 8, "name" => "Dende's Dragon", "airdate" => "3 Feb 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Dende's New Occupation!! The Dragon Balls are RevivedWith help from King Kai, Goku travels to Namek to recruit a new guardian for the Earth! Most of the Namekians refuse the offer, but there's one little guy who can't wait to go! Dende is back, and he's going…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423790.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e9", "season" => 6, "number" => 9, "name" => "The Puzzle of General Tao", "airdate" => "10 Feb 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Goku's Perplexing Problem?! The Dragon Balls are Taken BackGoku comes face to face with an old adversary: General Tao! The search for the Dragon Balls led Goku to the aging general, but unless the Super Saiyan can solve the crafty villain's puzzle, the search…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423791.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e10", "season" => 6, "number" => 10, "name" => "The Games Begin", "airdate" => "17 Feb 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Cell's Standing Challenge!! The Opening to the Decisive BattleThe wait is over, and the Cell Games are ready to begin! The Z-Fighters arrive ringside, only to discover another challenger already on the scene. It's none other than World Martial Arts Champion,…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423733.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e11", "season" => 6, "number" => 11, "name" => "Losers Fight First", "airdate" => "3 Mar 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Wait Just a Minute!! The Great Satan Army ArrivesCaroni and Pirozhki, Mr. Satan's top students, make a spectacular entrance to the ring, but are they really ready to rumble with Cell? Don't miss a minute of the fun, because this fight could be over fast!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423734.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e12", "season" => 6, "number" => 12, "name" => "Goku vs. Cell", "airdate" => "10 Mar 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Goku's Bout!! The Super-Tense Cell GamesGoku and Cell start fighting with each other in the ring. If Cell wins then he'll destroy the earth. If Goku wins then the Cell will give up.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423735.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e13", "season" => 6, "number" => 13, "name" => "Cell's Bag of Tricks", "airdate" => "17 Mar 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "A Direct Hit to the Earth!! Cell's Huge KamehamehaCell attacks Goku with a dazzling array of moves including the Destructo Disk, the Special Beam Cannon, and even the Kamehameha Wave! Goku matches the monster blow for blow, but how long can he last against su…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423736.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e14", "season" => 6, "number" => 14, "name" => "No More Rules", "airdate" => "31 Mar 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Lose or Die?! Goku, A Secret Turnabout PlanAs the battle intensifies, Cell quickly grows tired of the rules he created for the tournament. With a flick of his finger, the Android destroys the ring, instantly turning the Cell Games into a deadly fight to the f…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423737.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e15", "season" => 6, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Fight is Over", "airdate" => "7 Apr 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "The End of the Desperate Struggle!! Goku Surrenders?!Goku blasts Cell with a Kamehameha Wave that reduces the android to a pile of cinders, but his triumph is short-lived. The monster shows his amazing resilience by fully regenerating himself!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423738.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e16", "season" => 6, "number" => 16, "name" => "Faith in a Boy", "airdate" => "14 Apr 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Someone Who Will Succeed the Strongest… His Name is GohanAfter surrendering to Cell, Goku names the next challenger to enter the Cell Games: Gohan! Goku has supreme faith in his son's abilities, but the young Saiyan will need a lot more than his father's conf…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423739.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e17", "season" => 6, "number" => 17, "name" => "Gohan's Plea", "airdate" => "21 Apr 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Get Angry, Gohan—Release the Dormant Power WithinThe fight between Gohan and Cell intensifies, but the villain's attacks seem to have no effect on the boy! Could the young hero really have the power to defeat the evil android once and for all?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423740.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e18", "season" => 6, "number" => 18, "name" => "Android Explosion", "airdate" => "28 Apr 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Miniature Threats!! The Cell Juniors AttackCell is determined to unleash Gohan's full potential, but the boy refuses to fight, prompting the android to torture Gohan's friends instead! Next, Cell does the unthinkable by spawning miniature Cells to attack the…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423741.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e19", "season" => 6, "number" => 19, "name" => "Cell Juniors Attack!", "airdate" => "5 May 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The Tragedy of No. 16!! Super Gohan's Anger ExplodesGohan boils with rage as the Cell Juniors wreak havoc on the Z-Fighters. The boy struggles to resist the urge to fight, but he's a powder keg waiting to explode, and Android 16 appears ready to light the fus…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423742.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e20", "season" => 6, "number" => 20, "name" => "Awakening", "airdate" => "12 May 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Anger Exploding Into Power!! The Cell Juniors are Destroyed\"The Unleashing\" - After Android 16 tells Gohan to unleash his powers. Gohan becomes super sayan and starts destroying cells children.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423743.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e21", "season" => 6, "number" => 21, "name" => "The Unstoppable Gohan", "airdate" => "19 May 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Cell is Knocked Out!! Taken Down With Two Super PunchesCell's desire for battle turns into a nightmare as Gohan unleashes the full fury of his strength. The evil android powers up to his maximum level, but will it be enough to spare him from the wrath of Supe…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423744.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e22", "season" => 6, "number" => 22, "name" => "Cell's Break Down", "airdate" => "26 May 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Cell's Disaster!! The Destruction of His Perfect FormGohan's Super Saiyan strength appears to have no limit, and the young hero delivers a blow so severe it causes Cell to cough up Android 18!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423745.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e23", "season" => 6, "number" => 23, "name" => "A Hero's Farewell", "airdate" => "2 Jun 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Bye-Bye Everyone!! Goku's Last Instant MovementClearly overmatched by Gohan, Cell initiates his last line of defense: a self-destruct program that will blow up the entire planet! With only seconds to spare, Goku risks everything to transport Cell away from th…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423746.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e24", "season" => 6, "number" => 24, "name" => "Cell Returns!", "airdate" => "16 Jun 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "The Nightmare is Reborn!! An Absolute and Perfect TerrorThe nightmare continues! Cell explodes, but a particle of his nucleus survives the blast, providing all the android needs to regenerate himself! Restored to his ultimate form, Cell returns to the Earth m…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423747.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e25", "season" => 6, "number" => 25, "name" => "The Horror Won't End", "airdate" => "23 Jun 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "From Goku to Gohan… A Father's Spirit is Passed DownVegeta lashed out against Cell but was incapacitated in a single blow. Gohan jumps in front to save Vegeta and is wounded in the process. Cell and Gohan unleash their devastating Kamehameha waves as they col…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423749.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e26", "season" => 6, "number" => 26, "name" => "Save the World", "airdate" => "30 Jun 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "The Fight is Over… Thank You, Son GokuThe final showdown begins! While Goku telepathically coaches Gohan from the Other World, the Z-Fighters jump in for a five-sided attack! Gohan has the potential inside him, but can Goku show him how to unlock it?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423750.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e27", "season" => 6, "number" => 27, "name" => "Goku's Decision", "airdate" => "7 Jul 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "I Will Carry On in the Afterlife!! Farewell with a SmileCell is finally defeated, but the Z-Fighters still have much to resolve! Can they make it to the Lookout in time to heal the badly-injured Gohan? Is Android 18 still a threat? And can our heroes find a w…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423751.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e28", "season" => 6, "number" => 28, "name" => "One More Wish", "airdate" => "14 Jul 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "A New Day Will Come… Father! I'll Hang in ThereWith one more wish left, what shall the Z-Fighters wish for?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423752.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s6e29", "season" => 6, "number" => 29, "name" => "Free the Future", "airdate" => "21 Jul 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Peace and order have been restored on Earth in the present, but Trunks' future world is still a place of darkness and despair! Once he arrives home, the future will be forever changed!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423753.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 7, "name" => "Season 7", "rating" => 8, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s7e1", "season" => 7, "number" => 1, "name" => "Warriors of the Dead", "airdate" => "28 Jul 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "When Goku hears about a martial arts master known as the Grand Kai, he rushes to meet him for a lesson! Meanwhile, Cell, Frieza, King Cold and the Ginyu Force have teamed up to take control of Other World!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423754.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e2", "season" => 7, "number" => 2, "name" => "Tournament Begins", "airdate" => "11 Aug 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Goku must train for 10,000 years before he can study under the Grand Kai! But when the West, South, and East Kaiâ&#x20AC;ôs decide to hold an Other World Tournament, Goku gets his chance! All he has to do is defeat the greatest fighters of all time!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423755.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e3", "season" => 7, "number" => 3, "name" => "Water Fight", "airdate" => "18 Aug 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The Other World Tournament advances to the Quarter-Finals, and the battles are out of this world! Goku's opponent, Arqua, appears to be a wimp, but things change quickly when he transforms the entire ring into water!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423756.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e4", "season" => 7, "number" => 4, "name" => "Final Round", "airdate" => "25 Aug 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Goku advances to the final round of the tournament where he will face the warrior Pikkon! Sparks of energy fly as the brawlers battle for the title! When Pikkon reveals a Piccolo-like secret, Goku must up the ante! It's Super Saiyan time!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423758.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e5", "season" => 7, "number" => 5, "name" => "Goku vs.Pikkon", "airdate" => "1 Sep 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Goku may be a Super Saiyan, but can he withstand Pikkon's unbelievable Thunder Flash Attack?! And that's not all! While Goku's been fighting in Other World, seven years have passed on Earth, Gohan is now a teenager!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423759.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e6", "season" => 7, "number" => 6, "name" => "Gohan Goes to High School", "airdate" => "8 Sep 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "7 Years Since That Event! Starting Today, I'm a High SchoolerOn his first day of high school, Gohan stops a truckload of bank robbers by turning Super Saiyan. Now, the city can't stop talking about this mysterious \"Gold Fighter!\" Can Gohan get through class w…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423098.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e7", "season" => 7, "number" => 7, "name" => "I am Saiyaman!", "airdate" => "15 Sep 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "The Champion and Lover of Justice — The Great Saiyaman AppearsAfraid he will be recognized by his classmates, Gohan gets Bulma to design a retractable super-hero costume that he can activate in an instant. Say goodbye to Gohan - and hello to Saiyaman.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423101.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e8", "season" => 7, "number" => 8, "name" => "Gohan's First Date", "airdate" => "29 Sep 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Gohan's Confusing First Date?!Gohan thinks being a super-hero is a snap until a pretty girl named Angela discovers his secret. When Angela threatens to tell all unless he goes on a date with her, Gohan's life suddenly becomes more complicated than ever!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423113.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e9", "season" => 7, "number" => 9, "name" => "Rescue Videl", "airdate" => "20 Oct 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Gohan, Get Moving Quick! Rescue Videl!!When the Red Shark Gang kidnaps the mayor and demands a showdown with Mr. Satan, it's Videl who answers the challenge. Gohan knows Videl is in over her head, but he can't leave his classroom to help her without blowing h…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423114.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e10", "season" => 7, "number" => 10, "name" => "Blackmail", "airdate" => "27 Oct 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "A Robbery Case!! The Culprit is Saiyaman?!When a greedy circus promoter kidnaps a baby dinosaur, all he sees are dollar signs! Little does he know, that the dinosaur is a close, personal friend of the Great Saiyaman!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423115.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e11", "season" => 7, "number" => 11, "name" => "I'll Fight Too", "airdate" => "3 Nov 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Goku's Also Resurrected?! He's Participating in the Tenka'ichi Budōkai!!The Great Saiyaman is about to become a movie star but the hero's brush with stardom better not take long, because he has to hurry up and tell all of his old friends the big news: Goku is…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423116.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e12", "season" => 7, "number" => 12, "name" => "The Newest Super Saiyan", "airdate" => "10 Nov 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Even Gohan is Surprised! Goten's Explosion of PowerWhile training for the upcoming tournament, Gohan discovers that Goten has already reached the level of Super Saiyan! Sparks fly when the brothers spar, but the main event happens when Videl meets Chichi for…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423407.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e13", "season" => 7, "number" => 13, "name" => "Take Flight, Videl", "airdate" => "17 Nov 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.5, "summary" => "Ah, I Flew!! Videl's Introduction to FlightWith the Tournament fast approaching, Videl and Goten must learn to fly! Miles away, Vegeta holds a training session of his own, and his young son, Trunks, has a big surprise in store for him", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423408.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e14", "season" => 7, "number" => 14, "name" => "Gather for the Tournament", "airdate" => "24 Nov 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Welcome Back, Goku! The Whole Z Team Assembles!!Videl learns to fly, and Gohan and Goten do some last minute honing of their Super Saiyan skills. On the island where the tournament will be held, a special guest arrives! What do you say to a hero who's been de…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423410.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e15", "season" => 7, "number" => 15, "name" => "Camera Shy", "airdate" => "8 Dec 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "You're in Danger, Saiyaman! Guard Yourself Against a Perfectly Timed Photo?!Everyone qualifies for the World Tournament.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423420.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e16", "season" => 7, "number" => 16, "name" => "The World Tournament", "airdate" => "15 Dec 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "No Small Matter!! Little TrunksThe action begins as the World Martial Arts Tournament opens with the Junior Division! Thirty-five young fighters vie for the prize, but the matches prove to be more comedy than competition - until Trunks steps into the ring!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423421.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e17", "season" => 7, "number" => 17, "name" => "Trunks vs. Goten", "airdate" => "22 Dec 1993", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "It's My Turn!! Goten's Anxious First FightGoten and Trunks breeze through the Junior Division of the tournament until they find themselves going head-to-head in the finals! Who will win this exciting match? This is one championship fight you won't want to mis…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423422.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e18", "season" => 7, "number" => 18, "name" => "Best of the Boys", "airdate" => "12 Jan 1994", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Happiness Times a Million! The Junior Champion is Decided!!The match for the Junior Division World Championship continues as Goten and Trunks battle for the title! The winner of this final joust becomes the new World Champion! Can Goten outwit the cunning Tru…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423427.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e19", "season" => 7, "number" => 19, "name" => "Big Trouble, Little Trunks", "airdate" => "19 Jan 1994", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Now What, Satan?! The Greatest Pinch in HistoryAfter winning the championship, Trunks fights an exhibition match against Mr. Satan! Can the Champ hold on to his reputation as the world's strongest fighter? Meanwhile, two mysterious figures reveal themselves t…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423429.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e20", "season" => 7, "number" => 20, "name" => "Who Will Fight Who?", "airdate" => "26 Jan 1994", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "The Match-Ups Are Decided!! Hurry and Hold the First RoundTrunks and Gohan infiltrate the adult competition at the tournament by donning the disguise of Mighty Mask. The pairings for the day matches are selected. The first to fight: Krillin vs. Pintar, a man…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423434.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e21", "season" => 7, "number" => 21, "name" => "Forfeit of Piccolo", "airdate" => "2 Feb 1994", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "What's the Matter, Piccolo?! An Unheard-of No-Fight ForfeitPiccolo stuns the crowd by surrendering to his mysterious opponent before the first punch is thrown! Next into the ring is Videl, who must face the enormous Spopovitch. Will she be able to handle such…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423442.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e22", "season" => 7, "number" => 22, "name" => "A Dark and Secret Power", "airdate" => "9 Feb 1994", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Undyingly Unpleasant?! The Mystery of SpopovitchVidel takes to the ring for what is expected to be an easy victory over Spopovitch. She hits the towering brute with everything shes got, but her attacks have no effect. It seems Spopovitch is possessed by a sup…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423443.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e23", "season" => 7, "number" => 23, "name" => "Videl is Crushed", "airdate" => "16 Feb 1994", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "A Tragic Videl!! Are You Coming Out, Angry Super Gohan?To everyones horror, Spopovitch delays his inevitable victory for the purposes of torturing Videl! It appears the muscle-bound thug isn't going to stop until he kills her! Will Videl make it out of the ri…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423444.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e24", "season" => 7, "number" => 24, "name" => "Identities Revealed", "airdate" => "23 Feb 1994", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Exposed!! The Saiyaman is Son GohanGohan's identity is finally discovered as he takes his place on the tournament floor, but he has bigger things to worry about. His opponent, Kibito, is determined to see him transform into a Super Saiyan!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423445.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s7e25", "season" => 7, "number" => 25, "name" => "Energy Drain", "airdate" => "2 Mar 1994", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "A Slithering Conspiracy!! Gohan's Power is StolenWhen Gohan transforms into a Super Saiyan, Spopovitch and Yamu spring into action! Armed with a mysterious energy-draining device, the pair launch an attack on the golden-haired teen.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/569/1423446.jpg"),
